condition on the end of the buffer from the sixth rule, which the guard,
first in the chain, now holds for every rule. 10,466,336 small updates
agree with the fourth rule written separately from the code, 6,239,744
with the fifth rule and the sixth rule, 10,126,208 with the seventh,
15,468,864 with the eighth and 15,468,864 with the ninth. Over the
33,690 recorded updates of 3,286 recordings the patch differs from the
version before it on 2 updates. Over the 38,774 recorded updates of
